@startuml context-diagram
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: System Context Diagram (DFD Level 0)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #E65100
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}

left to right direction

actor "Driver" as Driver
actor "Parking Owner" as Owner
actor "Building Manager" as Manager
actor "Security Guard" as Guard
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "0.0\nParkEase BD\nShared Parking Platform" as System

rectangle "SSLCOMMERZ\nPayment Gateway (Sandbox)" as SSL #E3F2FD
rectangle "OpenStreetMap\nTile Service" as OSM #E3F2FD

Driver --> System : Search filters, vehicle data,\nquote/hold/payment requests,\ncheckout requests, reviews, disputes
System --> Driver : Search results, quotes, booking\nstatus, QR/OTP credential,\npayment & refund status, notifications

Owner --> System : Property & spot data, availability\nrules, Manager & Guard invitations,\npayout account & payout requests
System --> Owner : Verification & building-approval\nstatus, bookings, active sessions,\nearnings, payout status, notifications

Manager --> System : Link acceptance, building-approval\ndecisions, spot & availability updates,\nGuard assignments, dispute responses
System --> Manager : Link invitations, pending approvals,\nbookings & sessions (no amounts),\nincident reports, notifications

Guard --> System : Assignment acceptance, verification\ncredential, check-in/out confirmation,\nincident reports
System --> Guard : Assigned properties, expected\narrivals, active vehicles

Admin --> System : Verification decisions, approval\nwaivers, account actions, dispute\nresolutions, payout approvals, settings
System --> Admin : Pending reviews, disputes,\nreconciliation data, audit logs

System --> SSL : Payment session request
SSL --> System : IPN payment validation callback

System --> OSM : Map tile requests
OSM --> System : Map tile images

note bottom of System
  The system is the single authority for
  booking availability, price, payment
  validation, refunds, owner earnings,
  and role- and property-scoped authorization.
  Managers never receive financial data.
end note

@enduml
